== Architecture

The package has a strict layered structure (@fig:architecture). Each layer depends only on the layers below it. The integrators know nothing about gravity: they see a `ForceModel` that returns accelerations. The simulation driver knows nothing about specific integrators: it sees the abstract `Integrator` interface. Visualisation and analysis only consume trajectories.

