    [Integrators], [measured convergence order $= p plus.minus 0.35$ for all fixed-step methods; exact force-evaluation counts (FSAL); reversibility at round-off level iff symmetric; bounded energy error iff symplectic; $det M = 1$ iff symplectic; conservation of $bold(P)$ (all methods) and $bold(L)$ (symplectic methods)],
